    <briefdescription>
<para>The calibration plugins shipped with horus_human. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>ImuStaticPose the subject holds a known reference pose (default: upright, all segments aligned with the world frame); computes the sensor-to-segment rotation and the gyro bias, and rejects the window if the subject moved.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>InsoleZeroOffset the foot is unloaded (lifted / seated); stores the per-cell pressure and total-force offsets.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>EmgMvc the subject performs a maximum voluntary contraction; stores the peak of the envelope, by which live EMG is then normalised. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
